          "example": [],
          "level": 0,
          "type": "field",
          "summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/InscryptionAPI.RuleBook.RuleBookManager.RuleBookPageInfoExt.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Tracks all rulebook redirects that this ability's description will have. Explanation of the variables is as follows:\nKey (string): the text that will be recoloured to indicate that it's clickable.\nTuple.Item1 (PageRangeType): the type of page the redirect will go to. Use PageRangeType.Unique if you want to redirect to a custom rulebook page using its pageId.\nTuple.Item2 (Color): the colour the Key text will be recoloured to.\nTuple.Item3 (string): the id that the API will match against to find the redirect page. Eg, for ability redirects this will be the Ability id as a string.</p>\n",
          "platform": null,
          "docurl": "https://github.com/InscryptionModding/InscryptionAPI/new/main/docs/apiSpec/new?filename=InscryptionAPI_RuleBook_RuleBookManager_RuleBookPageInfoExt_RulebookDescriptionRedirects.md&value=---%0Auid%3A%20InscryptionAPI.RuleBook.RuleBookManager.RuleBookPageInfoExt.RulebookDescriptionRedirects%0Asummary%3A%20'*You%20can%20override%20summary%20for%20the%20API%20here%20using%20*MARKDOWN*%20syntax'%0A---%0A%0A*Please%20type%20below%20more%20information%20about%20this%20API%3A*%0A%0A",
